        "description": "409 with deliberate code: RESTORE_REQUIRED, PARENT_INACTIVE, IMMUTABLE_SCOPE, DIAGRAM_DEPENDENCY, DIAGRAM_REFERENCE_BROKEN, TRASH_IMPACT_CHANGED, RESTORE_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED or RESTORE_IMPACT_CHANGED; identify affected children/occurrences and remedy.",
